# Manual API requests for the REST Client VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Upload a document. To try another sample (see samples/README.md), change the `<` path and the part's Content-Type:
#   ../../samples/text.pdf      application/pdf
#   ../../samples/scanned.pdf   application/pdf
#   ../../samples/mixed.pdf     application/pdf
#   ../../samples/photo.jpg     image/jpeg
# @name upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../samples/text.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### Get the document from the last upload request; its `status` is pending, processing, done or failed
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{upload.response.body.$.id}}

### Get the text of the document from the last upload request, one entry per page; empty until the document's status is done
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{upload.response.body.$.id}}/pages

### Get a document that does not exist, to see an error response
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
